  "visualBrief": "Bird’s Nest as built: 24 diamond column trusses, continuous pale-gray square steel bands wrapping an unglazed saddle surface, enlarged fixed oval roof with ETFE above and acoustic PTFE below, red concrete bowl and public stairs visible through the lattice, three tiers of red-to-pale seating, running track, sunken field and opposing screens.",
